{"title":"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/9/4e9de7501af1f289ba226fca90b6d1194af77518.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25^{64}\\cdot 64^{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> is the square of a positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />. In decimal representation, the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/9/129c58dc0f5511a544b9285d6e9ca3c8885ac11a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 7\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 14\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 21\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 28\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 35$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"378\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking the root, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/a/d0abc68766718b29c4adecacd99ea0f3f5fde835.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=\\sqrt{25^{64}\\cdot 64^{25}}=5^{64}\\cdot 8^{25}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"215\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Now, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/6/826e40915d01ffa89d3d042d7156f68d1988cdec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N=5^{64}\\cdot 8^{25}=5^{64}\\cdot (2^{3})^{25}=5^{64}\\cdot 2^{75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"287\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Combining the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/8/358cbc9777547b31f9e0a8458d47d833666462fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2\\cdot 5)^{64}\\cdot 2^{(75-64)}=(2\\cdot 5)^{64}\\cdot 2^{11}=10^{64}\\cdot 2^{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"340\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p>This is the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/e/ade582b767f93cb8ade6938238a0d0e79ec5c62f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2048$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> with a string of sixty-four <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s at the end. Thus, the sum of the digits of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/9/fc97ef67268cd4e91bacdf12b8901d7036c9a056.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/4/654103fb6320bd26428cc4e254fe7eae588b38eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2+4+8=14\\Longrightarrow\\boxed{\\mathrm{ (B)}\\ 14}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"216\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B\">2002 AMC 10B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_4\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_10\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2002 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=